title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.game_over = 1;
this.achieve('game_completed');
!}

= End


@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.


@achievements
title: Achievements
view-if: achievement_game_completed == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

= Completed Achievements in this Playthrough

You have completed a playthrough. More achievements will be added with the later endings.


@end_game
game-over: true
